<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Banco Frances raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Banco Frances del Rio del la Plata SA to buy from hold and set a 12-month price target of $30.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 22-3/4 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
